[{"id":179582050,"discussion_id":"518c904d3239dc4cb93412565b9faac8239b91db","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `grouped_bias_add_grad` 算子内核中的同步（tongbu）bug。主要涉及两个方面的改动：一是在 `CopyDataIn` 与 `ReduceSum` 之间插入 `MTE3_V` 事件同步屏障，确保数据搬运完成后再执行归约计算；二是将 `groupIdx` 的累积索引转宽度逻辑从 `CopyInGroup` 中移除，改为在 `Process` 主循环中按需动态计算，避免了对原始 `groupIdx` 数据的原地修改。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`ProcessMultiHBlock` / `ProcessSingleHBlock` 增加同步屏障**：在 `grouped_bias_add_grad_cut_gh.h` 中，`CopyDataIn` 之后、`ReduceSum` 之前新增 `SetFlag<HardEvent::MTE3_V>` + `WaitFlag<HardEvent::MTE3_V>` 事件同步，防止数据未就绪时提前触发归约。\n- **`ProcessSplitH` 增加同步屏障**：在 `grouped_bias_add_grad_cut_h.h` 中，对 `hMainLen` 和 `hTailLen` 两个分支的 `CopyDataIn` 之后同样新增 `MTE3_V` 同步等待，确保搬运完成后再执行 `ReduceSum`。\n- **`groupIdx` 宽度计算逻辑迁移**：`grouped_bias_add_grad_cut_h.h` 中删除了 `CopyInGroup` 内将累积索引原地转为每行长度的循环（`groupIdx_.SetValue(i, ...)` 减法操作），改为在 `Process` 循环中通过 `groupIdx_.GetValue(i) - groupIdx_.GetValue(i - 1)` 实时计算 `g_`，避免修改原始数据影响后续逻辑。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T11:19:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T11:26:33+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179582052,"discussion_id":"852c9f17a71352a94338ec1f1c98acd24819d308","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**已审查文件：**\n- `math/grouped_bias_add_grad/op_kernel/arch35/grouped_bias_add_grad_cut_gh.h` — 发现 1 个问题（P2）\n- `math/grouped_bias_add_grad/op_kernel/arch35/grouped_bias_add_grad_cut_h.h` — 发现 1 个问题（P2）\n\n**按优先级统计：**\n- P0: 0\n- P1: 0\n- P2: 2\n- P3: 0\n\n**整体风险评估：中等**\n\n本 PR 的核心改动是在 `ProcessMultiHBlock`、`ProcessSingleHBlock`（cut_gh.h）和 `ProcessSplitH`（cut_h.h）中添加了 `MTE3_V` 流水线同步，以修复 MTE3 数据搬运与 V 向量运算之间的同步问题。同步修复本身的放置位置和逻辑是正确的。\n\n但 `BinaryReduceSum` 函数（两个文件各一个）存在完全相同的 `CopyDataIn → ReduceSum` 模式，却未获得相同的 `MTE3_V` 同步修复。该函数由 `Process` 的分支 2（大块数据二分累加路径）触发，存在 V 单元读到 MTE3 未完成写入的脏数据的风险，可能导致精度异常。建议补充同步。\n\n其余变更（格式调整、`groupIdxType_` 逻辑从 `CopyInGroup` 迁移到 `Process` 的按需计算、命名空间关闭注释修正）均为正确且合理的改动。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T11:19:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T11:32:13+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179582069,"discussion_id":"817add084d34889b65783faf63f6c9000f9fda9b","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n liaohuming, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-11T11:19:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T11:19:55+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179582070,"discussion_id":"69d4669b0f39e716ced93b162887f61e5c63625d","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\